// Slice render_rw10: RenderWare, tenth (last) pass of the band 0x450000-0x4FFFFF -- what render_rw9 left unreached on the
// six replay routes, the engine / sky device start-up and the two small callbacks render_rw9 had kept back: 59
// functions, started from p3fes_handgen and made readable (game/src/render/render_rw10.cpp).
//
// Groups (sub_* keep their symbols/functions.json names; proposed names in brackets, symbols/deltas/render_rw10.sym; RW
// 3.x public API names only where the body does what that API does):
//   * PS2 native data: the geometry / world-sector native plugin callbacks and stream readers / writers (sub_49BCD0 ..
//     sub_49F040), the sky driver's raster / texture native writers and sizes (sub_4D8440, sub_4DF140 .. sub_4DF870),
//     the raster image fills (sub_4EB7E0, sub_4EBB40) and the sub-raster globals (sub_4E9680);
//   * Rt2d: the font create / read / metrics readers / string drawers (sub_46BFB0, sub_4A6CE0 .. sub_4A98A0), the path,
//     pick-region and scene streams, the shape stroke, the anim-prop blend, Rt2dMaestroCreate (sub_4ACB90 .. sub_4B43C0);
//   * textures: the image-stored texture dictionaries (sub_4BCCD0 .. sub_4BDA10), the default mipmapped read
//     (sub_4CFFD0), RpMatFX's material copy (sub_467860);
//   * RtTileRender and its callbacks (sub_4BEC20 .. sub_4BF560), the RtFS path / exists helpers and RwFgets
//     (sub_4BF880 .. sub_4C0FC0), the sce file device's status callback (sub_4C0F70);
//   * streams: string write / Unicode read, camera read, the spline stream read (sub_4C7460 .. sub_4C7B90, sub_48D0E0);
//   * world / PTank: RpWorldAddClump (sub_49C240), PTank's instancing and quad geometries (sub_47BD20, sub_486340);
//   * start-up: RwEngineInit (sub_4CA850), RwEngineOpen, RwEngineStart, SkyUseMode, skyCustomModeIsOk, the frame /
//     display buffer rasters (SkyCreateFBRaster / SkyCreateDBRaster), the DMA handler removal (sub_4D6700).
//
// The rules the pair tests check (tests/game/test_render_rw10.cpp):
//   * hand body == recompiled body (registers and cycles at every check point and the return, 32 MiB of RAM with the
//     dead stack, scratchpad, BIOS window, bus log, stand-in call logs and heaps) on the three replay snapshots, each
//     body fed pointer soups of the snapshot's live RW free-list entries, and on the p3fes_handgen random worlds;
//   * sub_4E9680 stores the raster and its sub-rectangle in the sky globals and returns 1.
//
// The band 0x450000-0x4FFFFF after this pass -- what stays recompiled, and why (the 187 candidates the slice left,
// counted from its exclusion list): 67 are pair-tested as callees by another slice's test (taking them would break that
// test), 53 are SCE libgraph / libdma / libmpeg code, 27 touch hardware registers or use COP0 / sync in their own body,
// 11 are hardware-named wrappers, 22 were claimed by another packet, and 7 are the boot-only start-up paths. sub_48D960
// [splineRead] stays too: test_field8_sys's resource-manager worker reaches it on the dorm snapshot, where its stream
// call (0x48D99C) goes through a null slot -- recompiled and not emitted, that pair stops at its call; hand-written, it runs.

